    <data key="d0">Vizio Telemetry and Analytics Architecture</data>
    <data key="d1">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BlCXEMp_lqY</data>
    <data key="d2">Architecture for ingesting billions of TV telemetry events using Kinesis, Firehose, S3, Redshift, and QuickSight.</data>
